SUMMARY:Stroll & Savasana: Yoga in the Park
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260920
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260921
DTSTAMP:20260912T135149Z
UID:72b85caa66db8456415a48d0b545@ctvisit-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the changing of the seasons (and Reliance Health's 5
 0th anniversary!) with this grounding outdoor event at Mohegan Park! We wi
 ll begin with a nature walk led by TLGV on the paved path around Spaulding
  Pond\, observing the flora and fauna of the park\, followed by a beginner
 -friendly yoga practice led by Ellen Gunther (RYT200) of Reliance Health. 
 No yoga experience necessary! Please bring your own yoga mat if possible -
  supplies are limited. Inclement weather cancels. Sponsored by Reliance He
 alth & The Last Green Valley\, recovery.com & thelastgreenvalley.org\n\nSo
 urce: https://ctvisit.com/events/stroll-savasana-yoga-park
LOCATION:165-247 Mohegan Park Rd\, Norwich CT\, 06360
URL:https://ctvisit.com/events/stroll-savasana-yoga-park
END:VEVENT
